\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {World-model-evaluation deep-dive}: the 34 benchmarks of the world-model-evaluation lane, by sub-type -- the P3 counterpart of the skill-building branch deep-dive. \textbf  {Mode}: \textcolor {teal!72!black}{\textsf  {Gen}}\ evaluates generated video, \textcolor {blue!62!black}{\textsf  {QA}}\ video question-answering, \textcolor {violet!72!black}{\textsf  {Pred}}\ physical prediction. \textbf  {Signal}: \textcolor {black!55}{\textsf  {Auto}}\ computed/learned metric, \textcolor {ForestGreen!88!black}{\textsf  {Acc}}\ accuracy vs ground truth, \textcolor {orange!85!black}{\textsf  {VOE}}\ violation-of-expectation, \textcolor {magenta!72!black}{\textsf  {Human}}\ human study. \textbf  {Physical}: targets physical-law understanding, \textcolor {ForestGreen}{{\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 52}}\ core, \textcolor {orange!90!black}{\textbf  {\textasciitilde }}\ adjacent, \textcolor {BrickRed}{{\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 56}}\ general. Generation-quality suites dominate and are physics-agnostic; only the physical-reasoning and physical-commonsense sub-types test physical law, and every lane benchmark scores open-loop, never in a closed loop.\relax }}{13}{table.6}\protected@file@percent }
